{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L744","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:744"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Options for a single "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"emitCustomEvent"},{"type":"text","value":" call, on both the tool-execution and\nmiddleware contexts."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Properties"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"batch","children":[{"type":"text","value":"batch?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional batch?: boolean;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L753","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:753"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Keep this event in the durability batch with later chunks.\nCUSTOM events flush as soon as they are emitted, so a progress\nindicator can render at emit time. Pass "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{ batch: true }"},{"type":"text","value":" for a\nhigh-volume stream that should share appends with later output.\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"process.stdout"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"process.stderr"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sandbox.file"},{"type":"text","value":", and\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sandbox.file.diff"},{"type":"text","value":" already batch."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"batch","text":"batch?","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:744](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L744)\n\nOptions for a single `emitCustomEvent` call, on both the tool-execution and\nmiddleware contexts.\n\n## Properties\n\n### batch?\n\n```ts\noptional batch?: boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:753](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L753)\n\nKeep this event in the durability batch with later chunks.\nCUSTOM events flush as soon as they are emitted, so a progress\nindicator can render at emit time. Pass `{ batch: true }` for a\nhigh-volume stream that should share appends with later output.\n`process.stdout`, `process.stderr`, `sandbox.file`, and\n`sandbox.file.diff` already batch.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: EmitCustomEventOptions\ntitle: EmitCustomEventOptions\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:744](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L744)\n\nOptions for a single `emitCustomEvent` call, on both the tool-execution and\nmiddleware contexts.\n\n## Properties\n\n### batch?\n\n```ts\noptional batch?: boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:753](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L753)\n\nKeep this event in the durability batch with later chunks.\nCUSTOM events flush as soon as they are emitted, so a progress\nindicator can render at emit time. Pass `{ batch: true }` for a\nhigh-volume stream that should share appends with later output.\n`process.stdout`, `process.stderr`, `sandbox.file`, and\n`sandbox.file.diff` already batch.\n"}
